      "entryId": "shanhaijing-08-03",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "钟山之神，名曰烛阴，视为昼，瞑为夜"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-11-08",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "山名，一说即今内蒙古阴山；一说在今新疆境内"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-11-08",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "流沙出钟山，西行又南行昆仑之虚，西南入海"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "entryId": "soushenji-05-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "为神。”汉末，为秣陵尉，逐贼至钟山下，贼击伤额，因解绶缚之，有顷"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-03-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "临蝯眩之岸，不足以滑其和；譬若钟山之玉，炊以炉炭，三日三夜而色泽"
    }
  ],
